segments.source:
This translates to the system of equations
      <me>
        \syseq{
        7x + y + 3z = \lambda x ;
        -3x + 2y - 3z = \lambda y ;
        -3x - 2y - z = \lambda z
        }
        \quad\xrightarrow{\phantom{MMM}}\quad
        \syseq{
        (7-\lambda)x + y + 3z = 0 ;
        -3x + (2-\lambda)y - 3z = 0 ;
        -3x - 2y + (-1-\lambda)z = 0\rlap.
        }
      </me>
      This is the same as the homogeneous matrix equation
      <me>
        \mat{7-\lambda, 1 3; -3 2-\lambda, -3; -3 -2 -1-\lambda}\vec{x y z} = 0,
      </me>
      i.e., <m>(A-\lambda I_3)v = 0</m>.

segments.translation:
이는 연립방정식 <me>
        \syseq{
        7x + y + 3z = \lambda x ;
        -3x + 2y - 3z = \lambda y ;
        -3x - 2y - z = \lambda z
        }
        \quad\xrightarrow{\phantom{MMM}}\quad
        \syseq{
        (7-\lambda)x + y + 3z = 0 ;
        -3x + (2-\lambda)y - 3z = 0 ;
        -3x - 2y + (-1-\lambda)z = 0\rlap.
        }
      </me>로 바뀝니다. 이는 동차 행렬 방정식 <me>
        \mat{7-\lambda, 1 3; -3 2-\lambda, -3; -3 -2 -1-\lambda}\vec{x y z} = 0,
      </me>, 즉 <m>(A-\lambda I_3)v = 0</m>과 같습니다.
